23
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:45,300
He won't

24
00:00:47,966 --> 00:00:48,766
Oh

25
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:52,433
Sister you're here too

26
00:00:52,833 --> 00:00:53,700
Is it a bad time

27
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:55,633
Of course not

28
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,500
